## Summary of recurring anti-patterns

| Anti-pattern                    | Example                                | Fix                                                                       |
|---------------------------------|----------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Single-letter loop vars         | `a`, `i`, `st`, `it`                   | Use full words: `assignee`, `line_number`, `status`, `item`               |
| Unnecessary abbreviations       | `cat`, `pri`, `cfg`, `disc_val`, `acc` | Spell out: `category`, `priority`, `config`, `discount_value`, `accuracy` |
| Ambiguous bare plurals          | `valid`, `errors`, `rows`, `raw`       | Qualify: `valid_users`, `validation_errors`, `raw_rows`, `raw_data`       |
| ML tunnel-vision                | `X`, `y`                               | Prefer domain terms: `features`, `target`                                 |
| Missing qualifier on file paths | `deploy_marker`, `valid_path`          | Add type: `deploy_marker_file`, `valid_users_path`                        |

